'''Dragon Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[A Colossal New Year! (2023)|A Colossal New Year!]] during New Year's 2024. It was added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dragon Doge
|image = E 676.png
|first appearance = [[A Colossal New Year! (2023)|A Colossal New Year!]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a Doge wearing a dragon costume. It moves as fast as a [[Doge Dark]] but has ''slightly'' lower stats than it, making it a bit more threatening than a regular Doge. However, in its final debut levels, it is buffed to a point comparable to [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], but without the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait.

